{
    "word": "falsity",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                "word": "falsity",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6cc1b6e6-9582-4367-985a-a2d80461efe3",
                        "entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "falsities"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f6ec86a-edd5-34f5-b759-a76b3a5ff03d",
                        "entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something that is false; an untrue assertion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ded4f57-4cd4-404a-93ea-d7b17da01a02",
                                "sense_id": "6f6ec86a-edd5-34f5-b759-a76b3a5ff03d",
                                "text": "The belief that the world is flat is a falsity."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "880736fa-7804-35d9-96a6-e07885e8248c",
                        "entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The characteristic of being untrue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6641dcab-bf72-4a10-bffb-0b39c0b91144",
                                "sense_id": "880736fa-7804-35d9-96a6-e07885e8248c",
                                "text": "The falsity of that statement is easily proven."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39dcd52b-d393-43c6-a20f-b78ecfd0281b",
                                "sense_id": "880736fa-7804-35d9-96a6-e07885e8248c",
                                "text": "The Party intellectual knows in which direction his memories must be altered; he therefore knows that he is playing tricks with reality; but by the exercise of DOUBLETHINK he also satisfies himself that reality is not violated. The process has to be conscious, or it would not be carried out with sufficient precision, but it also has to be unconscious, or it would bring with it a feeling of falsity and hence of guilt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70be3422-4023-4fd4-8262-008a604c3cce",
                        "source_entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                        "source_sense_description": "untrue assertion",
                        "target_lang_word": "nepravda",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nepravda",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "387c93e0-7750-3a76-9a60-5f7b42cd652e",
                                        "entry_id": "54665528-06b1-3f69-bb07-7757284cd6da",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sdělení, které neodpovídá skutečnosti"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9002a006-c174-4cbb-9b6a-0f4ae9268c1c",
                                                "sense_id": "387c93e0-7750-3a76-9a60-5f7b42cd652e",
                                                "text": "Část Florišova projevu obsahuje podle Kollárové nepravdy a antisemitská klišé a relativizuje utrpění židovského obyvatelstva v období druhé světové války, a to také na území dnešního Slovenska."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd90826f-d90e-424f-ba11-b8c175e4f33a",
                                                "sense_id": "387c93e0-7750-3a76-9a60-5f7b42cd652e",
                                                "text": "Mluvčí ani neskrývá, že je si vědomý, že říká nepravdu, je mu jasné, že to ví i publikum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96aaf581-2cb0-4faa-b4ec-0ebbd74c0773",
                        "source_entry_id": "96879a67-2a09-3d7e-ba53-f6ec26e01add",
                        "source_sense_description": "untrue assertion",
                        "target_lang_word": "fausseté",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fausseté",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0287d39-2fdc-30af-a24f-c1ae167609ea",
                                        "entry_id": "ed047a2c-6298-3172-bbab-c20580fd7420",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualité d’une chose fausse, ce qui rend une chose fausse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc4995a2-2275-4894-b79d-6fd824dd69b2",
                                                "sense_id": "c0287d39-2fdc-30af-a24f-c1ae167609ea",
                                                "text": "Berce-toi donc de cette croyance, dit de Bracy, jusqu’à ce que le temps en ait prouvé la fausseté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "386e6501-6070-3860-880e-596f73b8ec8b",
                                        "entry_id": "ed047a2c-6298-3172-bbab-c20580fd7420",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cette chose fausse elle-même."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc5349e4-b679-4c51-8a5d-34d0f0a3923b",
                                                "sense_id": "386e6501-6070-3860-880e-596f73b8ec8b",
                                                "text": "Il a vomi des faussetés contre les vertus de nos médicaments, comme si c’étaient des inventions de Satan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe05ee80-a6a6-495d-9074-8b4180e96284",
                                                "sense_id": "386e6501-6070-3860-880e-596f73b8ec8b",
                                                "text": "Tout ça, c’est un tas de faussetés ! cria Claudie avec aigreur, en s’approchant de nouveau de la trappe, d’un air courroucé. Vous êtes la plus mauvaise langue de l’endroit, et c’est pas qu’il en manque!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac0cdc13-0d09-414e-9c98-60e306de28b7",
                                                "sense_id": "386e6501-6070-3860-880e-596f73b8ec8b",
                                                "text": "Sur le plan des faits, Zemmour est un historien, il ne commet pas de faussetés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d17b478-580f-3261-ba6b-82c57cd17072",
                                        "entry_id": "ed047a2c-6298-3172-bbab-c20580fd7420",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Duplicité, hypocrisie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd745f7f-6754-4939-b02a-261038da0cc3",
                                                "sense_id": "5d17b478-580f-3261-ba6b-82c57cd17072",
                                                "text": "Haj Garne n’a pas besoin de sérum de vérité pour se trahir. Il est l’incarnation par excellence de la fausseté. Son sourire, ses éclats de rire, ses grasses taloches sur l’épaule ne sont que leurre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7625b1f0-8821-4e0f-be76-0cd40705ac5f",
                                                "sense_id": "5d17b478-580f-3261-ba6b-82c57cd17072",
                                                "text": "Il est d’une grande fausseté."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80720097-7452-417e-9e5f-d4184b30f222",
                                                "sense_id": "5d17b478-580f-3261-ba6b-82c57cd17072",
                                                "text": "Sa fausseté sera démasquée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcf7f133-711a-4d61-be29-91f71a43fa96",
